ist. — Isa 48:17; Lu 1:79.","refs":[["Isa",48,17,48,17],["Luke",1,79,1,79]]},{"text":"(Set on a rock,) of stability. — Ps 40:2.","refs":[["Ps",40,2,40,2]]},{"text":"(Set in a large place,) of liberty. — Ps 31:8.","refs":[["Ps",31,8,31,8]]},{"text":"(Sliding,) of yielding to temptation. — Job 12:5; Ps 17:5; 38:16; 94:18.","refs":[["Job",12,5,12,5],["Ps",17,5,17,5],["Ps",38,16,38,16],["Ps",94,18,94,18]]},{"text":"(Treading under,) of complete destruction. — Isa 18:7; La 1:15.","refs":[["Isa",18,7,18,7],["Lam",1,15,1,15]]},{"text":"(Washed or dipped in oil,) of abundance. — De 33:24; Job 29:6.","refs":[["Deut",33,24,33,24],["Job",29,6,29,6]]},{"text":"(Dipped in blood,) of victory. — Ps 68:23.","refs":[["Ps",68,23,68,23]]}],"refCount":85}
